## Bundled: no-ai-slop, in write-like-me

`skills/write-like-me/no-ai-slop/` is a copy of the **[no-ai-slop](https://github.com/petergyang/no-ai-slop)**
skill by **Peter Yang**, MIT licensed, taken at commit `000650b` (2 September 2026).
It ships inside `write-like-me` so a fresh install gets the full slop pass without a
second install.

| File in this repo | Upstream file | Relationship |
