| `no-ai-slop/RULES.md` | `skills/no-ai-slop/SKILL.md` | Renamed so skill installers do not register it as a separate skill. One workflow line changed: "3-5 voice signals, kept internal" instead of an open list of traits. Everything else verbatim. |
| `no-ai-slop/eval.md` | `skills/no-ai-slop/eval.md` | One check added to the final read: the edit was verified against the file without separate editor and evaluator agents. Everything else verbatim. |
